  "source_url": "https://chartink.com/screener/first-resistance-all-timeframes",
  "description": "Pivot point (PP) = (High + Low + Close) / 3 *** First resistance (R1) = (2 x PP) – Low *** First support (S1) = (2 x PP) – High. *** Second resistance (R2) = PP + (High – Low) *** Second support (S2) = PP – (High – Low)  ***  Third resistance (R3) = High + 2(PP – Low) *** \r\nThird support (S3) = Low – 2(High – PP)   *** S1. S2. R1. R2. Ravi Dahiya.",
  "created_at": "2022-06-22T04:46:48.000000Z",
  "is_private": false,
  "is_favourite": 0,
  "is_alert_present": 0,
  "atlas_query": "( nifty 500 ( 2 * ( ( 1 day ago high + 1 day ago low + 1 day ago close ) / 3 ) - 1 day ago low > latest close and 2 * ( ( 2 day ago  high + 2 day ago  low + 2 day ago  close ) / 3 ) - 2 day ago  low <= 1 day ago  close and 2 * ( ( 1 week ago high + 1 week ago low + 1 week ago close ) / 3 ) - 1 week ago low > weekly close and 2 * ( ( 2 week ago  high + 2 week ago  low + 2 week ago  close ) / 3 ) - 2 week ago  low <= 1 week ago  close and 2 * ( ( 1 month ago high + 1 month ago low + 1 month ago close ) / 3 ) - 1 month ago low > monthly close and 2 * ( ( 2 month ago  high + 2 month ago  low + 2 month ago  close ) / 3 ) - 2 month ago  low <= 1 month ago  close ) )",
